The graph shows the time $t$ hours needed to travel $240$ km at an average speed of $s$ km/h.
How long does the trip take at $60$ km/h?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\begin{axis}[width=8cm,height=7cm,axis lines=middle,axis line style={-{Stealth}},xmin=-4,xmax=94,ymin=-1,ymax=14.5,xtick={0,10,...,90},ytick={0,1,...,13},grid=both,clip=false,scaled ticks=false,ticklabel style={font=\scriptsize,/pgf/number format/fixed},xlabel={$s$},ylabel={$t$}]
\addplot[thick,blue!70!black,<->,domain=18.5:92,samples=140] {240/x};
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

